# Packing rules for the MCP server sub-package.
#
# This file exists for one reason: npm falls back to a directory's
# .gitignore when that directory has no .npmignore, and mcp-server/.gitignore
# excludes `dist/`. The result was a tarball whose `files` allowlist said
# `mcp-server` but which shipped no `mcp-server/dist/index.js` — an install
# (git, tarball or npm) that looked complete and then had no MCP tools,
# because the spawned entry point was missing.
#
# With this file present, npm-packlist uses it instead of .gitignore for this
# subtree, and `dist/` ships. It also means the root .npmignore's
# `mcp-server/src/` rule no longer reaches this subtree, so the source
# exclusions have to be repeated here.

src/
tests/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
